        {
          "text": " Basi Daudi akawakusanya Israeli wote, toka Shihori, kijito cha Misri, hadi pa kuingilia Hamathi, ili walilete sanduku la Mungu kutoka Kiriath-yearimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.5",
